---
import Notes from "@pres/components/Notes.astro";
import CaptionedImage from "@pres/components/CaptionedImage.astro";
import dam from "./assets/hydropower.jpg";
export const meta = {"title":"CaptionedImage · 图注"};
---

<div style="height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 1.5rem 2.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
  <h2 style="font-size: 2.6rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #333;">CaptionedImage · 图注位置</h2>
  <div style="flex: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center;">
    <div style="max-width: 340px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <CaptionedImage
        src={dam.src}
        alt="湖泊与水坝"
        caption="captionPosition：above（默认）"
        captionPosition="above"
      />
    </div>
    <div style="max-width: 340px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <CaptionedImage
        src={dam.src}
        alt="湖泊与水坝"
        caption="captionPosition：below"
        captionPosition="below"
      />
    </div>
    <div style="max-width: 340px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <CaptionedImage
        src={dam.src}
        alt="湖泊与水坝"
        caption={["captionPosition：inside", "支持多行文本"]}
        captionPosition="inside"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<Notes>

CaptionedImage 的三种图注位置：above（默认，图上方）、below（图下方）、inside（覆盖在图片底部）。caption 传字符串数组即可多行。

</Notes>
